
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>THE HOLLOW | Unknown Entity</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    background: #080808;
    color: #ddd;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
}

header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #441010;
}

header h1 {
    color: #a00000;
    font-size: 38px;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px darkred;
}

header p {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

.container {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 25px;
}

.warning {
    color: #bd2525;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 34px;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.date {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.monster {
    height: 390px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #242424 0%, #090909 65%, #000 100%);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid #331010;
}

.shadow {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -45px;
    width: 220px;
    height: 290px;
    background: #000;
    border-radius: 48% 48% 10% 10%;
    filter: blur(2px);
}

.mask {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 125px;
    height: 165px;
    background: linear-gradient(110deg, #bbb, #eee 45%, #777);
    border-radius: 48% 48% 43% 43%;
    transform: rotate(-5deg);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #777;
}

.eye {
    position: absolute;
    top: 48px;
    width: 25px;
    height: 35px;
    background: #050505;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #111;
}

.eye.left {
    left: 20px;
    transform: rotate(15deg);
}

.eye.right {
    right: 20px;
    transform: rotate(-15deg);
}

.mouth {
    position: absolute;
    top: 88px;
    left: 43px;
    width: 39px;
    height: 65px;
    background: #050505;
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: rotate(4deg);
}

.mask:after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 3px;
    height: 30px;
    background: #777;
    left: 61px;
    top: 5px;
    transform: rotate(12deg);
}

.caption {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-style: italic;
}

.article {
    margin-top: 35px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.article p {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.article h3 {
    color: #a00000;
    margin: 28px 0 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

blockquote {
    border-left: 3px solid darkred;
    padding: 15px;
    color: #aaa;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 25px 0;
    background: #111;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid #441010;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

@media(max-width:600px) {
    header h1 { font-size: 28px; }
    h2 { font-size: 27px; }
    .monster { height: 330px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>THE UNKNOWN</h1>
    <p>PARANORMAL INVESTIGATION ARCHIVE</p>
</header>

<main class="container">

    <div class="warning">
        SPECIAL REPORT / CASE NO. 001
    </div>

    <h2>THE HOLLOW: A FACE IN THE DARK</h2>

    <div class="date">
        UNKNOWN ORIGIN | UNIDENTIFIED INDIVIDUAL
    </div>

    <div class="monster">
        <div class="shadow"></div>
        <div class="mask">
            <div class="eye left"></div>
            <div class="eye right"></div>
            <div class="mouth"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="caption">
        Illustration of the unidentified figure.
    </div>

    <section class="article">

        <p>
        Residents of a quiet town have reported sightings
        of a mysterious individual known only as
        <b>"The Hollow."</b> Nobody knows where the figure
        came from, and nobody has been able to explain
        its sudden appearances.
        </p>

        <h3>THE APPEARANCE</h3>

        <p>
        Witnesses describe the individual as a tall,
        completely black silhouette. Its face is hidden
        behind a pale, distorted mask resembling a
        frozen scream. Its unnatural expression makes
        it difficult to forget.
        </p>

        <h3>THE SIGHTINGS</h3>

        <p>
        The first reported sighting happened near an
        abandoned building. Since then, people have
        claimed to see the figure standing at the end
        of empty streets, watching silently before
        disappearing into the darkness.
        </p>

        <h3>THE FEAR</h3>

        <p>
        Nobody knows its identity, intentions, or purpose.
        Stories about the figure have spread throughout
        the town, leaving residents questioning whether
        it is simply an urban legend or something
        that has yet to be understood.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
        "I saw something standing outside.
        It had no face... only a scream."
        <br><br>
        — Anonymous witness
        </blockquote>

        <h3>THE FINAL QUESTION</h3>

        <p>
        Some believe The Hollow is only a story created
        to frighten people. Others insist that the
        sightings are real.
        <br><br>
        But one question remains:
        <b>WHO — OR WHAT — IS THE HOLLOW?</b>
        </p>

    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    THE UNKNOWN ARCHIVE © 2026
    <br><br>
    SOME SECRETS ARE BETTER LEFT UNANSWERED.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
